.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 
Public BLAKE3 hasher implementation used by the \fBSystemEx\fP hashing subsystem\&. 

\fBBlack3Hasher\fP is a high‑level wrapper around the internal BLAKE3 chunk and tree‑hashing engine\&. It supports keyed hashing, endian‑aware output conversion, and integrates with the \fBSystemEx\fP attribute‑driven hashing model via \fBHashAlgorithmAttribute\fP\&. 

.PP
Unlike simple one‑shot hash functions, this hasher drives the full BLAKE3 state machine: chunk accumulation, compression, chaining‑value propagation, and finalization\&. It produces stable 32‑bit and 64‑bit hash values suitable for identifiers, lightweight integrity checks, or general hashing tasks\&. 
.PP
